Median (M):
Median Class Position  =  \frac{N}{2}  =  \frac{50}{2}  =  \boxed{25\text{th observation}}
Class: Class 30 - 40 (where L = 30, cf = 17, f = 20, c = 10)
M  =  L + [ \frac{\frac{N}{2} - cf}{f} ] × c  =  30 + [ \frac{25 - 17}{20} ] × 10  =  30 + \frac{80}{20}  =  30 + 4  =  \boxed{34.00 orders}

Mode (Z):
Modal Class: Class 30 - 40 (Highest frequency f₁ = 20, f₀ = 12, f₂ = 10, L = 30, c = 10)
Z  =  L + [ \frac{f₁ - f₀}{2f₁ - f₀ - f₂} ] × c  =  30 + [ \frac{20 - 12}{2(20) - 12 - 10} ] × 10  =  30 + [ \frac{8}{18} ] × 10  =  30 + 4.44  =  \boxed{34.44 orders}

First Quartile (Q₁):
Position  =  \frac{N}{4}  =  \frac{60}{4}  =  \boxed{15\text{th item}}
Class: Class 10 - 20 (where L = 10, cf = 8, f = 12, c = 10)
Q₁  =  L + [ \frac{\frac{N}{4} - cf}{f} ] × c  =  10 + [ \frac{15 - 8}{12} ] × 10  =  10 + \frac{70}{12}  =  10 + 5.83  =  \boxed{15.83 units}

Third Quartile (Q₃):
Position  =  \frac{3N}{4}  =  \frac{3(60)}{4}  =  \boxed{45\text{th item}}
Class: Class 30 - 40 (where L = 30, cf = 40, f = 14, c = 10)
Q₃  =  L + [ \frac{\frac{3N}{4} - cf}{f} ] × c  =  30 + [ \frac{45 - 40}{14} ] × 10  =  30 + \frac{50}{14}  =  30 + 3.57  =  \boxed{33.57 units}

Fourth Decile (D₄):
Position  =  \frac{4N}{10}  =  \frac{4(60)}{10}  =  \boxed{24\text{th item}}
Class: Class 20 - 30 (where L = 20, cf = 20, f = 20, c = 10)
D₄  =  L + [ \frac{\frac{4N}{10} - cf}{f} ] × c  =  20 + [ \frac{24 - 20}{20} ] × 10  =  20 + \frac{40}{20}  =  20 + 2  =  \boxed{22.00 units}

Seventieth Percentile (P₇₀):
Position  =  \frac{70N}{100}  =  \frac{70(60)}{100}  =  \boxed{42\text{nd item}}
Class: Class 30 - 40 (where L = 30, cf = 40, f = 14, c = 10)
P₇₀  =  L + [ \frac{\frac{70N}{100} - cf}{f} ] × c  =  30 + [ \frac{42 - 40}{14} ] × 10  =  30 + \frac{20}{14}  =  30 + 1.43  =  \boxed{31.43 units}

